---
import HvacSite from '../../../components/demos/HvacSite.astro';
---

<HvacSite title="Newburgh, NY" current="area">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-800">Service area</p>
  <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">Heating &amp; AC service in Newburgh, NY</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
    <p>
      This page shows the Growth package's local SEO setup for one service area: a page written for one town, with the business name, address, and phone matching its Google Business Profile.
    </p>
    <p>
      A real version would describe the neighborhoods served, the kinds of homes and systems common in the area, and how to book. Behind the scenes it includes schema markup so search engines can read the business details.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Serving Newburgh and nearby</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Placeholder for the service-area details the business provides.</p>
    <a href="/demos/hvac/book" class="mt-4 inline-block font-semibold text-sky-800 hover:underline">Book a visit in Newburgh →</a>
  </div>
</HvacSite>
